Short:    Multi-Check V1.6 - Multi Archive Tester
Author:   siegel@in-ovation.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Uploader: siegel@in-ovation.de (Sascha Pfalz)
Type:     comm/bbs
Replaces: mcheck15.lha

This is V1.6 of the FAME/Amiex Archivetester. In this Version LHA,LZX,ZIP
and Textfiles are supported. Multi-Check is able to add & Remove adverts
from archives and also add header/tailer to textfiles. The BBS System
used will be automatically recognized by Multi-Check.

V1.6 is now able to add binary data as adverts to archives.
